  "description": "<p><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(55, 55, 55); font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">Duravo is an innovative new travel products company that has launched its first three products, including the toughest, yet lightest carry-on suitcase in its class. Developed in partnership with the makers of Curv</span><sup style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12px; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; color: rgb(55, 55, 55); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&reg;</sup><span style=\"color: rgb(55, 55, 55); font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">, a composite material used in ballistic gear, pro hockey skates, and EV auto components, Duravo's Flexshell</span>&trade; <span style=\"color: rgb(55, 55, 55); font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">composite material is 5X the strength of traditional plastics, enabling thin but extremely lightweight construction.</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(55, 55, 55); font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">Flexshell is a new, patent-pending composite material manufactured in&nbsp;</span><span class=\"xn-location\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(55, 55, 55); font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Germany</span><span style=\"color: rgb(55, 55, 55); font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\"> that uses a combination of high-strength, molecularly oriented thermoplastic fibers and eco-friendly polymers. As a result, the material is highly impact resistant, and resists cracking or permanently deforming under high force and extreme temperatures. This</span><span style=\"color: rgb(55, 55, 55); font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\"> strong-yet-thin material provides 2 to 5 pounds of weight savings over carry-on luggage made with current materials, enabling travelers to significantly increase what they can pack while remaining within the requirements of airline restrictions.</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Duravo is excited to launch its affiliate program and join forces with new affiliate partners. With our pricepoints and compelling value, earning $25 or more on every sale is an attractive addition for any affliate eager to join us in introducing our products to a highly active market.</span></p>",
